  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The scorpion makes two Claw attacks and one Sting attack.\n\nClaw. Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13) from one of two claws.\n\nSting. Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage plus 11 (2d10) Poison damage.",
